Task: Set up Row Level Security policies for user_books table

Summary:
- Created comprehensive RLS policies for all three tables
- Designed for public discovery while protecting user data

Policies by table:
- profiles: SELECT all, UPDATE own only
- books: SELECT all, INSERT authenticated
- user_books: SELECT all, INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE own only

Security considerations:
- Public browsing enabled (MVP requirement)
- Data modification restricted to owners
- Future: friend-based borrowing restrictions

Files created:
- supabase/migrations/002_rls_policies.sql

Why: Implements security at the database level, ensuring users
can only modify their own data while enabling public discovery.
